@managerToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJtYW5hZ2VyQGdtYWlsLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc5MjU2NTIyNywiZXhwIjoxNzkyNTY4ODI3fQ.gaZYdWKZEynCeSv_4HLm8gzsac_MpVpDzc02Qq10mGw

### ============================================================================
### FLOW 1: MEMBERSHIP SUBSCRIPTION (POST /api/v1/memberships/subscribe)
### ============================================================================

### 1.1 Subscribe to a membership package (Basic)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memberships/subscribe
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

{
  "memberId": 6,
  "packageId": 4,
  "startDate": "2026-10-21"
}

### 1.2 Subscribe with different package (Premium package)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memberships/subscribe
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

{
  "memberId": 5,
  "packageId": 3,
  "startDate": "2026-10-07"
}

### 1.3 Subscribe with standard package (3-month plan)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memberships/subscribe
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

{
  "memberId": 6,
  "packageId": 2,
  "startDate": "2026-10-01"
}

### 1.4 Get active membership for a member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memberships/members/1004/active
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 1.5 Get membership history for a member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memberships/members/1004
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 1.6 Get subscription expiration date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memberships/members/4/expiration
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 1.7 Renew a subscription with new package
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memberships/6/renew?packageId=2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 1.8 Cancel a subscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/memberships/1002/cancel
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### ============================================================================
### FLOW 2: CLASS BOOKING (POST /api/v1/classes/{classId}/book)
### ============================================================================

### 2.1 Book a class (Basic booking)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes/1/book?memberId=6
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 2.2 Book a different class
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes/2/book?memberId=1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 2.3 Book a class for another member
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes/3/book?memberId=2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 2.4 Book a class for a third member
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes/4/book?memberId=3
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 2.5 Get a specific booking details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 2.6 Get all bookings for a specific class
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes/1/bookings
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 2.7 Get all bookings for a specific member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/members/1/bookings
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 2.8 Cancel a booking
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bookings/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 2.9 Get all bookings for a member (alternative endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/members/2/bookings
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 2.10 Book multiple classes (Sequential bookings for same member)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes/5/book?memberId=1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### ============================================================================
### FLOW 3: REVENUE REPORTS (GET /api/v1/reports/revenue)
### ============================================================================

### 3.1 Get revenue report for current month (October 2026)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/revenue?startDate=2026-10-01T00:00:00&endDate=2026-10-31T23:59:59
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### 3.2 Get revenue report for Q4 2026
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/revenue?startDate=2026-10-01T00:00:00&endDate=2026-12-31T23:59:59
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### 3.3 Get revenue report for last 30 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/revenue?startDate=2026-09-07T00:00:00&endDate=2026-10-07T23:59:59
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### 3.4 Get revenue report for year 2026
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/revenue?startDate=2026-01-01T00:00:00&endDate=2026-12-31T23:59:59
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### 3.5 Get revenue report for first half of 2026
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/revenue?startDate=2026-01-01T00:00:00&endDate=2026-06-30T23:59:59
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### 3.6 Get revenue report for second half of 2026
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/revenue?startDate=2026-07-01T00:00:00&endDate=2026-12-31T23:59:59
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### 3.7 Get revenue report with manager token (Requires CENTER_MANAGER role)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/revenue?startDate=2026-10-01T00:00:00&endDate=2026-10-07T23:59:59
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### 3.8 Attempt to get revenue report without proper authorization (Should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/revenue?startDate=2026-10-01T00:00:00&endDate=2026-10-07T23:59:59
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}


### ============================================================================
### FLOW 4: CLASS MANAGEMENT
### ============================================================================

### 4.1 Create a class and assign a coach (Manager or Center Manager only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

{
  "className": "Beginner Yoga",
  "sportId": 1,
  "coachId": 3,
  "roomId": 1,
  "maxCapacity": 15,
  "scheduleTime": "2026-12-01T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 60
}

### 4.2 Attempt to create a class with a member token (expected: 403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

{
  "className": "Beginner Yoga",
  "sportId": 1,
  "coachId": 2,
  "roomId": 1,
  "maxCapacity": 15,
  "scheduleTime": "2026-12-01T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 60
}

