### Register a new member
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "manager@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "fullName": "Manager",
  "phone": "0123456789"
}

### Login to get access token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "manager@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Get user details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/4
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}


### ============================================================================
### FLOW 7: USER MANAGEMENT & ROLE UPDATE (Manager only)
### ============================================================================

### 7.1 Update user role to COACH
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/4/role?roleName=COACH
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### 7.2 Update user role to RECEPTIONIST
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/5/role?roleName=RECEPTIONIST
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

