### ============================================================================
### FLOW 11: SUPPORT TICKETS (H? TR? THÀNH VIÊN)
### ============================================================================

### 11.1 Member creates a support ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/support-tickets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

{
  "subject": "Yêu c?u d?i gi? t?p l?p Yoga",
  "content": "Tôi b?n công tác vào th? 2, mong trung tâm h? tr? chuy?n sang l?p th? 4."
}

### 11.2 Member views their own support tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/support-tickets/my
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{memberToken}}

### 11.3 Receptionist/Manager lists all open tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/support-tickets?status=OPEN
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### 11.4 Receptionist resolves a support ticket
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/support-tickets/1/resolve
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

{
  "response": "L? tân dã h? tr? chuy?n l?ch h?c sang th? 4 thành công cho b?n."
}

### ============================================================================
### NOTES:
### ============================================================================
###
### Before running these tests:
### 1. Start the Spring Boot application: ./mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run
### 2. Ensure SQL Server database is running with SportsCenterDB schema
### 3. Replace @memberToken with actual token from login endpoint
### 4. Replace @managerToken with token from a MANAGER or CENTER_MANAGER user.
###    The register endpoint below creates a MEMBER, not a manager account.
### 5. Adjust memberId, packageId, and classId based on your database data
### 6. For class creation, use existing sportId, coachId (a COACH user), roomId,
###    and a scheduleTime in the future
###
### Expected Results:
### - Flow 1: Subscription should return 201 with subscription details
### - Flow 2: Booking should return 201 with booking details
### - Flow 3: Revenue report should return 200 with BigDecimal total (Manager only)
### - Flow 4: Class creation should return 201 with the new class details
### - Flow 5: Adding a sport should return 201; listing sports should return 200
### - Flow 6: Adding a room should return 201; listing rooms should return 200
###
### ============================================================================
